  "findings": {
    "multicolor": "Fixed colours, the same under a purple foreground style: heart and heart.fill, trash, trash.fill and trash.circle.fill (white glyph) systemRed 255,56,60; leaf and leaf.fill systemGreen 52,199,89; bolt, bolt.fill, star, star.fill, sun.max.fill and exclamationmark.triangle.fill systemYellow 255,204,0; flag.fill systemOrange 255,141,40; xmark.octagon.fill red with a white glyph; checkmark.circle.fill systemBlue 0,136,255 and plus.circle.fill green, each with a white glyph. Badges: the dot of bell.badge, bell.badge.fill, app.badge and envelope.badge red; the plus of folder.badge.plus, person.crop.circle.badge.plus, cart.badge.plus and calendar.badge.plus a green disc with a white plus (calendar.badge.plus also draws its calendar red); person.crop.circle.badge.checkmark a blue disc; the symbol itself in the foreground style. flame, drop, sun.max, snowflake, umbrella.fill, pawprint.fill, tortoise.fill, hare.fill, checkmark.seal.fill, pencil.circle.fill and xmark.bin follow the foreground style. Clouds and moons (cloud.fill, cloud.sun.fill, moon.fill, moon.stars.fill) are white, with a yellow sun and cyan 0,192,232 rain.",
    "hierarchical": "One foreground colour at three strengths: the glyph at full, an outline container (star.circle, info.circle, trash.circle), a badge's symbol (bell.badge) and the waves of speaker.wave.3.fill at 0.5 (255,156,158 over white from 255,56,60), and a filled container (checkmark.circle.fill, person.crop.circle.fill) at 0.25 (255,206,207). heart.fill, wifi and person.crop.circle draw in one colour.",
    "palette": "Two styles with no rendering mode draw exactly as .palette. The glyph or badge takes the first style; a badge's symbol or a cloud's sun the second; a filled container the third, or the second when two are given. One style paints every layer that colour (a solid disc, no knockout). .hierarchical, .monochrome and .multicolor ignore a second style.",
    "variable": "Parts above the value are drawn at 0.3 (178 over white from black). A part lights when the value is above its share rounded to hundredths: wifi (dot, two arcs) and speaker.wave.3 light parts above 0, 0.33 and 0.67, so 0.67 leaves the last dim; cellularbars above 0, 0.25, 0.5 and 0.75; speaker.wave.2 above 0 and 0.5. At 0 every part is dim; the speaker itself never dims.",
    "effects": "Frames are kept by every effect. .disappear, .disappear.down and .appear hide the symbol while active; isActive: false draws it. .bounce and .variableColor draw it as it is at rest (variableColor animates); .scale.up draws it about 1.25 times larger. .symbolEffectsRemoved() between the effect and the symbol draws it again; one written after the effect, or symbolEffectsRemoved(false), does not.",
    "names": "names-1 to names-3 draw 144 of the names the preview maps as look-alikes, eight a row in the order of the fixture's sample lists, for reference."
  }
}
